<title>UK: Dixons up on UBS buy note, Capel upgrade.</title>
<headline>Dixons up on UBS buy note, Capel upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dixons Group Plc jumped to within striking distance of their May peak, after brokerage UBS issued a &quot;buy&quot; note, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Also bolstering the shares was an earnings upgrade from HSBC James Capel, they said. Capel increased its earnings estimate for the UK retailer to 185 million stg from 175 million stg, they said.</p>
<p>By 0830 GMT, the shares were up 13-1/2p to 571-1/2p, having climbed as high as 574p earlier.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
